WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
An attic workroom, lit by one candle.

2
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:08.430
A table, glass jars, and
an old book: Agrippa.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.900
The old book is swapped for
a modern chemistry book.

4
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:17.600
Outside, the seasons turn:
blossom, harvest, falling leaves.

5
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.720
And the figure at the
table never once looks up.

6
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:25.430
He writes: "Life and death
appeared to me ideal bounds".

7
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.710
Is this a warning against science?

8
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.170
Or something else?

9
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.850
In this mission, you'll
trace Victor's studies,

10
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.530
from the old alchemists to
modern chemistry at Ingolstadt.

11
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.200
You'll watch his ambition grow,
until it sweeps him along.

12
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:43.080
And you'll unpack the subtitle,
The Modern Prometheus:

13
00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.710
in Greek myth, the one who
stole fire from the gods.

14
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:51.150
Your mission: decide whether Frankenstein
is a warning against science,

15
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.340
or something else.
